# OWNER_OTP_PHONE: tasdiqlash OTP SMS yuboriladigan egasi telefoni.
# SUBSCRIPTION_PRICE: oylik narx (som), 240000–300000 oralig'ida (default qiymat).
# SMS_PROVIDER_API_KEY: SMS provayder kaliti (DevSMS uchun DEVSMS_TOKEN ishlatiladi).
